<title>BRAZIL: Petrobras BR Distribuidora H1 net lower.</title>
<headline>Petrobras BR Distribuidora H1 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Petrobras BR</p>
<p>Distribuidora, the distribution unit of state-run oil firm</p>
<p>Petrobras, announced the following first half</p>
<p>results.</p>
<p>		     H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit     $58 million	   $63.6 million</p>
<p>    Gross revs     $4.53 bln	 $4.15 bln</p>
<p>    Net worth     1.22 bln reais     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it showed a return on equity of</p>
<p>5.36 percent.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
